From 0073277c23bb15ccdbe269e1588a794c42f83f08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hamza <155834495+lonadonia@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:16:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] marianos-azure-headless 1.10.0rc7: version, release
 notes, the CSV option of validate-export, and the offline replay of a stored
 run

pyproject, __init__ and uv.lock name 1.10.0rc7 (the parser version stays 1.10.0, the
release series, by its documented rule). README: what 1.10.0rc7 changes. docs/CLI.md:
validate-export --file products.csv. tools/replay_routes.py: replays a stored run's
listings offline against the 1.9 baseline queue (each counted page's capture hashed and
parsed again, the audit of route_audit applied, one line per baseline listing, a detail
file per listing); no request is made.
